# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo stages coursework copied from the local Associates/ and Bachelors/
# folders. Those folders contain a lot of material that is NOT Sean's own work
# and should not be published: publisher slide decks, textbook chapters,
# journal article PDFs, lecture audio, graded report cards, and syllabi.
#
# They stay on disk locally; they just never reach GitHub. Five of them also
# exceed GitHub's hard 100 MB per-file limit and would cause an outright
# push rejection.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

